[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; THE CLUSTER ROUND. Carrier shell in, six bomblets out.
;
; The bomblets are ai_grenade_projectile.tscn — the same round the hand grenade
; and every other launcher fires. That is deliberate: one projectile scene means
; one place where fuses, blast ownership, contact monitoring and continuous
; collision are correct, and this shell only overrides the numbers it needs.
;
; Small blast, small bomblets. See cluster_shell.gd for why the shell itself
; barely hurts: the weapon sells ground denial over a second and a half, not a
; bigger bang. blast_damage 34 against the frag round's own, and each bomblet
; lands at 26 in a 3.4m circle.

